}

^"usage"{
  surface: "folios"
  role: "folio-scan"
  formats_available: ["avif", "webp"]
  alt_text: "Laminated folio, ochre, magenta and grey paint: HOW POMEGRANATE heads a grid of { & } braces, ?, ~ chains and spiral beads tagged EXTERNAL and INTERNAL, over RELATIONSHIP TO SENSES, RHYTHM ABOUT EXPRESSION, INSTRUMENTATION, MONITORING"
